### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "NighttimeUrbanLaneFollowing" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :description "Vehicle following too closely at night with potential lane intrusion risk" ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1, :vehicle2 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :nightCondition ;
    :hasRisk :laneIntrusionRisk1, :occlusionRisk1 ;
    :hasObstacle :roadObject1 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Yellow vehicle in front (ego vehicle)" .

:vehicle2 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Red vehicle in the distance" .

:roadObject1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Yellow lane markings and road surface" .

:nightCondition a :NightCondition .

:laneIntrusionRisk1 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of unintended lane drift due to poor visibility and close following distance" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:occlusionRisk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of obscured pedestrians or cyclists due to nighttime conditions" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.60"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.70"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.55"^^xsd:float .
```

